uted))]"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded border-[rgb(var(--color-border))]" required=""/><span>NaHaber haber bülteni e-postalarını almak istiyorum. Kişisel verilerimin KVKK kapsamında bülten gönderimi için işlenmesine açık rıza veriyorum. İstediğim zaman <a href="/bulten/cikis" class="underline hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">abonelikten çıkabilirim</a>.</span></label></form></section></div><div class="space-y-5 lg:pt-0.5"><div><h2 class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">Takip &amp; uygulama</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3"><nav aria-label="Sosyal medya" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><a href="https://x.com/nahabercom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="NaHaber X" class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[rgb(var(--color-muted))] transition-colors hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">X</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/nahabercom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="NaHaber Facebook" class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[rgb(var(--color-muted))] transition-colors hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">Facebook</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/nahabercom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="NaHaber Instagram" class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[rgb(var(--color-muted))] transition-colors hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">Instagram</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@nahabercom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="NaHaber YouTube" class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[rgb(var(--color-muted))] transition-colors hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-text))]">YouTube</a></nav><span class="hidden h-3 w-px bg-[rgb(var(--color-border))] sm:block" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/nahaber/id6784465855" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="NaHaber uygulamasını App St